---
description: >-
  The compatibility-mode twin of label-syntax.mmd, with legacyMarkdown set. A
  tree view has no label kind where v12 read markdown, so it draws exactly as
  the default one: markdown only in a quoted markdown string, tags draw, a
  written \n breaks the line; the rest as written (#1368).
config:
  legacyMarkdown: true
---
treeView-beta
  plain/
    unquoted **bold** _ital_
    "quoted **bold** _ital_"
  "`md dir **bold** _ital_`/"
    "`quoted md **bold** _ital_`"
    '`single md **bold** _ital_`'
  backticks/
    `bare **bold** _ital_`
    code a `code` b
  "tags <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i>/"
    unquoted tag<br>next
    "quoted <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i><br>next H<sub>2</sub>O"
  breaks/
    unquoted one\ntwo
    "quoted one\ntwo"
    "`md **one**\ntwo`"
  names/
    my_file_name.spec.ts
    __init__.py
